Abstraction

Allowing a user to ineract with a higher-level (mroe big picture) part of the program

Example:
	Using an oven.
	A user doesn't have to know all of the mechanical and electrical aspects to use the oven, they just turn a nob.

Alos referred to as
	information hiding
	encapsulation

abstract data type (ADT)
	

